      m_Calls: []
  m_text: PCFIX is an interactive, gamified web-based application to transform technical
    training in computer hardware assembly and disassembly. By bridging traditional
    hardware servicing instruction with an engaging digital format, the platform
    offers students a risk-free, hands-on environment to practice component recognition,
    correct installation sequences, and troubleshooting procedures. Designed to improve
    technical skill retention and practical proficiency, PCFIX provides an accessible,
    step-by-step learning experience that prepares learners for real-world computer
    systems servicing
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
