  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Preparation & ESD Safety: Power off system, disconnect power cord, place
    ESD mat, and wear anti-static wrist strap connected to unpainted metal.

    Case
    Opening: Remove retaining screws and slide off side panels.

    Cable Disconnection:
    Unplug 24-pin ATX power, 4-pin 12V power, and SATA power/data cables.

    Power
    Supply Unit (PSU): Unscrew mounting bolts on the back panel and slide the PSU
    out.

    Optical Drive: Unscrew mounting bolts from the drive bay and slide
    the drive out through the front.

    Hard Disk Drive (HDD): Unscrew mounting
    bolts from the drive cage and slide the drive out.

    Motherboard: Unscrew
    mounting bolts from standoffs and carefully lift the motherboard out of the case.

    RAM
    Modules: Push down retaining tabs at both ends of the memory slots to pop out
    the sticks.

    CPU Fan & Heatsink: Disconnect fan header, release locking lever/bolts,
    and lift cooler off the processor.

    CPU (Processor): Lift load lever, open
    socket plate, and carefully lift CPU out by its edges.

    Inventory & Documentation:
    Log all component specifications onto an inventory form.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0161d805a3764c089bef00bfe00793f5, type: 2}
