  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Preparation & ESD Safety: Wear anti-static wrist strap connected to unpainted
    metal and work on an electrostatic mat.

    Case Preparation & Component Cleaning:
    Remove case side panels and clean the CPU fan/heatsink with a brush.

    CPU
    Installation: Lift socket lever, align processor notch/triangle mark with socket,
    seat carefully, and lower lever to lock.

    Thermal Compound Application: Apply
    a small amount of thermal paste to the CPU and heatsink contact surface.

    CPU
    Cooler Installation: Mount fan/heatsink assembly over CPU, engage lock/screws,
    and plug fan connector into CPU_FAN header.

    RAM Installation: Align memory
    module notch with slot key and press firmly on both ends until retaining clips
    snap shut.

    Motherboard Installation: Align rear I/O with shield bezel, place
    board onto case standoffs, and tighten mounting screws.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3012bb4ef78d7114d877ea210c3ab548, type: 2}
